{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/flora-shore-calgary-properties-dubai-islands","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1315,"crm_id":"6439","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Flora Shore","slug":"flora-shore-calgary-properties-dubai-islands","display_address":"Dubai Islands","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Calgary Properties","price":2250000,"display_price":"2.25M","lattitude":25.300117533641,"longitude":55.298575524034,"min_bedrooms":2,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Flora Shore Beachfront Residences at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-islands/\">Dubai Islands</a> is a 15-storey project by Calgary Properties, designed by Mimar Architecture + Engineering. It features 76 modern apartments that bring together coastal living and city convenience in one of Dubai’s most attractive island communities.</p><p>Located on Island A of Dubai Islands, the development offers 2, 3, and 4-bedroom apartments designed with comfort and space in mind. With strong ROI potential, high-quality finishes, and a range of lifestyle amenities, Flora Shore is ideal for both living and investment.</p><p>The project features premium amenities such as an infinity swimming pool, an open-air gym, a yoga retreat, an outdoor cinema, co-working spaces, and dedicated kids’ areas, all designed to foster a lifestyle of comfort, leisure, and community. Residents enjoy proximity to key destinations, including the Dubai Marina, Burj Khalifa, and Dubai International Airport, ensuring both accessibility and exclusivity.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_d95e1e1b3e.jpg","hash":"Feature_d95e1e1b3e","name":"Flora Shore Tile Size.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-pr